---
layout: layouts/base.njk
pagination:
  data: locales
  size: 1
  alias: lang
permalink: "{{ '' if lang == 'ko' else 'en/' }}about/certifications/index.html"
title: 산업재산권 및 인증
description: 주식회사 하이탑이 보유한 신축이음장치 분야 등록 특허와 조달·기업 관련 공식 인증 내역입니다.
bodyClass: bg-surface text-ink
---

{% set visibleCerts = company.certifications | rejectattr("hold") %}

<section class="relative mt-20 h-[36vh] min-h-[280px] max-h-[380px] overflow-hidden bg-night">
  <img src="{{ '/images/hero/about-hero.webp' | lurl }}" alt="{{ '교량 구조와 기반시설을 표현한 이미지' | t }}"
       class="absolute inset-0 h-full w-full object-cover object-[center_54%]" width="1672" height="941" fetchpriority="high">
  <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-night/45"></div>
  <div class="absolute inset-x-0 bottom-0 h-44 bg-gradient-to-t from-night/75 to-transparent"></div>

  <div class="container-hi relative z-10 flex h-full flex-col justify-end pb-9 text-white sm:pb-11">
    <nav aria-label="{{ '브레드크럼' | t }}" class="mb-5 flex items-center gap-1.5 text-sm text-white/60">
      <a href="{{ '/' | lurl }}" class="transition-colors hover:text-white">{{ "홈" | t }}</a>
      <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-base" aria-hidden="true">chevron_right</span>
      <a href="{{ '/about/' | lurl }}" class="transition-colors hover:text-white">{{ "회사소개" | t }}</a>
      <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-base" aria-hidden="true">chevron_right</span>
      <span aria-current="page" class="text-white/90">{{ "산업재산권 및 인증" | t }}</span>
    </nav>
    <span class="eyebrow-line !text-white/60">Patents &amp; Certifications</span>
    <h1 class="mt-3 text-3xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-white [text-shadow:0_2px_18px_rgba(11,14,19,0.45)] sm:text-4xl">{{ "산업재산권 및 인증" | t }}</h1>
  </div>
</section>

<div class="container-hi">
  <nav class="cert-index" aria-label="{{ '문서 바로가기' | t }}">
    <a href="#patents">{{ "등록 특허" | t }} <span>{{ company.patents | length }}</span></a>
    <a href="#certifications">{{ "공식 인증" | t }} <span>{{ visibleCerts | length }}</span></a>
    <p>{{ "문서를 선택하면 크게 볼 수 있습니다." | t }}</p>
  </nav>
</div>

<section id="patents" class="cert-section container-hi">
  <header class="cert-section-heading">
    <h2>{{ "등록 특허" | t }} <span>{{ company.patents | length }}</span></h2>
    <p>{{ "신축이음장치·인도교 분야의 등록 특허" | t }}</p>
  </header>
  <div class="cert-grid">
    {% for p in company.patents %}
      {% set patentLabel = ("Patent No. " ~ p.no) if lang == "en" else ("특허증 제" ~ p.no ~ "호") %}
      <figure class="cert-item">
        <a href="{{ ('/images/certs/' ~ p.img ~ '.jpg') | lurl }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="cert-preview" aria-label="{{ patentLabel }} {{ '크게 보기' | t }}">
          <img src="{{ ('/images/certs/' ~ p.img ~ '-sm.jpg') | lurl }}" alt="{{ patentLabel }} {{ p.title | t }}" width="311" height="440" loading="lazy">
        </a>
        <figcaption class="cert-caption">
          <p class="cert-meta">{{ p.year }} · {{ "등록 특허" | t }}</p>
          <h3>{{ p.title | t }}</h3>
          <p class="cert-number">{% if lang == "en" %}No. {{ p.no }}{% else %}제{{ p.no }}호{% endif %}</p>
        </figcaption>
      </figure>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
</section>

<section id="certifications" class="cert-section container-hi">
  <header class="cert-section-heading">
    <h2>{{ "공식 인증" | t }} <span>{{ visibleCerts | length }}</span></h2>
    <p>{{ "기업 자격 및 직접생산 확인 자료" | t }}</p>
  </header>
  <div class="cert-grid">
    {% for c in visibleCerts %}
      <article class="cert-item">
        {% if c.img %}
          <a href="{{ ('/images/certs/' ~ c.img ~ '.jpg') | lurl }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="cert-preview" aria-label="{{ c.name | t }} {{ '크게 보기' | t }}">
            <img src="{{ ('/images/certs/' ~ c.img ~ '-sm.jpg') | lurl }}" alt="{{ c.name | t }}" width="311" height="440" loading="lazy">
          </a>
        {% else %}
          <div class="cert-preview"><p>{{ "인증서 이미지 준비 중" | t }}</p></div>
        {% endif %}
        <div class="cert-caption text-center">
          <h3>{{ c.name | t }}</h3>
        </div>
      </article>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
  <p class="mt-8 border-t border-line pt-5 text-xs leading-relaxed text-secondary">{{ "게시된 문서는 주소를 가린 공개용 사본입니다. 원본 확인이 필요하시면 문의해 주시기 바랍니다." | t }}</p>
</section>

{% set ctaTitle = "인증 사본이나 시험성적서가 필요하신가요?" %}
{% set ctaDesc = "공공조달 제출용 서류는 요청 주시면 안내해 드립니다." %}
{% set ctaSecondary = { label: "연혁 보기", url: "/about/history/" } %}
{% include "partials/cta-band.njk" %}
